## Original Content
Chinese official calls for more APEC efforts to remove trade barriers

## Summary
A Chinese official has called for increased efforts by APEC to remove trade barriers. The focus is on eliminating obstacles to promote international trade and economic cooperation. This aligns with broader global discussions on facilitating commerce.

## Key Points
- A Chinese official is urging enhanced APEC efforts.
- The primary goal is to remove trade barriers.
- Trade barriers are identified as impediments to economic growth.
- APEC is highlighted as a key platform for addressing trade issues.


